<messaging:emailTemplate subject="Travel Itinerary for {!relatedTo.Name} Confirmed" recipientType="User" relatedToType="KimbleOne__TravelRequisition__c"><messaging:htmlEmailBody > <html> <body style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f0f0f;text-align:left;"> <table width="600px" align="left" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;margin-top:20px;"> <tr><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;padding-bottom:5px;padding-top:10px;padding-right:5px;border-bottom-width:1px;border-left-style:none;border-bottom-style:solid;border-right-style:none;"><apex:image id="KimbleLogo" value="{!$Setup.KimbleOne__KimbleOneConfigSetting__c.KimbleOne__EmailTemplateLogoURL__c}"/></td></tr> <tr><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1em;font-size:1em;font-weight:bold;padding-top:15px;padding-bottom:12px;border-bottom-width:1px;border-bottom-style:solid;">Please confirm that the following Travel Itinerary is correct and is ready to be dispatched.</td></tr> <tr><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:bold;padding-top:10px;padding-bottom:8px;font-size:.8em;">Your approval will result in the item being passed to our Finance department for despatch. By rejecting the Travel Itinerary it will revert to a Draft state.</td></tr> <tr><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;padding-bottom:10px;">Follow the&nbsp;<apex:outputlink value="{!LEFT($Api.Partner_Server_URL_140,FIND('.com',$Api.Partner_Server_URL_140)+4)+relatedTo.Id}">Link</apex:outputlink> to view this Itinerary in Kimble.</td></tr> <tr> <td align="left" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;padding-bottom:10px;padding-top:10px;"> <table style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#0f0f0f;text-align:left;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:.7em;"> <tr> <th align="center" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-color:#8da8cd;border-color:#464b50;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;padding:4px;">{!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__TravelRequisitionItem__c.Fields.KimbleOne__TravelCategory__c.Label}</th> <th align="center" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-color:#8da8cd;border-color:#464b50;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;padding:4px;">Itinerary Notes</th> <th align="center" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-color:#8da8cd;border-color:#464b50;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;padding:4px;">{!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__TravelRequisitionItem__c.Fields.KimbleOne__BookingReference__c.Label}</th> <th align="center" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-color:#8da8cd;border-color:#464b50;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;padding:4px;">{!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__TravelRequisitionItem__c.Fields.KimbleOne__BookingNotes__c.Label}</th> </tr> <apex:repeat var="item" value="{!relatedTo.KimbleOne__TravelRequisitionItems__r}"> <tr> <td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-color:#c9dae6;border-color:#464b50;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;padding:4px;">{!item.KimbleOne__TravelCategory__r.Name}</td> <td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-color:#c9dae6;border-color:#464b50;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;padding:4px;">{!item.KimbleOne__SelectedTravelItineraryItem__r.KimbleOne__ItineraryNotes__c}</td> <td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-color:#c9dae6;border-color:#464b50;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;padding:4px;">{!item.KimbleOne__BookingReference__c}</td> <td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-color:#c9dae6;border-color:#464b50;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;padding:4px;">{!item.KimbleOne__BookingNotes__c}</td> </tr> </apex:repeat> </table> </td> </tr> <tr><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;padding-bottom:10px;">You can approve or reject this Travel Itinerary, by replying to this email and entering either <span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#1a8d4a;font-weight:bold;">APPROVED</span> or <span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#dd1d2e;font-weight:bold;">REJECTED</span> in the first line together with any comments in the second line. If you have any queries regarding this confirmation please contact the project owner.</td> </tr> <tr><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;padding-bottom:10px;border-bottom-width:1px;border-bottom-style:solid;">Regards<br/>{!$Organization.Name} {!$Label.kimbleone__emailtemplatesignature}</td> </tr> </table> </body> </html></messaging:htmlEmailBody><messaging:plainTextEmailBody > Please confirm that the following Travel Itinerary is correct and is ready to be dispatched. Your approval will result in the item being passed to our Finance department for despatch. By rejecting the Travel Itinerary it will revert to a Draft state. {!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__TravelRequisitionItem__c.Fields.KimbleOne__TravelCategory__c.Label} | Itinerary Notes | {!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__TravelRequisitionItem__c.Fields.KimbleOne__BookingReference__c.Label} | {!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__TravelRequisitionItem__c.Fields.KimbleOne__BookingNotes__c.Label} <apex:repeat var="item" value="{!relatedTo.KimbleOne__TravelRequisitionItems__r}"> {!item.KimbleOne__TravelCategory__r.Name} | {!item.KimbleOne__SelectedTravelItineraryItem__r.KimbleOne__ItineraryNotes__c} | {!item.KimbleOne__BookingReference__c} | {!item.KimbleOne__BookingNotes__c} </apex:repeat> You can approve or reject this Travel Itinerary, by replying to this email and entering either APPROVED or REJECTED in the first line together with any comments in the second line. If you have any queries regarding this confirmation please contact the project owner. Regards {!$Organization.Name} {!$Label.kimbleone__emailtemplatesignature}</messaging:plainTextEmailBody></messaging:emailTemplate>